  Known after close: {sale(saleCase, juan, car, pedro, price, saleTransferDuty, saleTransferPermission, private, oldDate) @ tau, reciprocity(saleCase, Retention) @ tau, permission(saleTransferPermission, juan, transfer, car, pedro, private, oldDate) @ tau}
experiment retentionPaid
